      "instance_name": "pedophile_stereotype",
      "label": "Pedophile Stereotype",
      "description": "A harmful and false stereotype that equates parenting with pedophilia. This is a malicious and baseless association used to dehumanize parents and children, and it is a form of hate speech that targets the family unit. It is explicitly listed in the provided knowledge base as a form of LGBTQ+ discrimination and hate speech.",
