      "description": "Speech that attacks or demeans a person or group based on attributes such as race, religion, gender, or sexual orientation. The meme's text is an example of hate speech because it uses a false and dangerous association (parenting = pedophilia) to attack and dehumanize parents and children, which is a protected characteristic under hate speech laws.",
