      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Hateful",
      "description": "The meme directly and maliciously attacks parents and children by falsely associating the act of having children with pedophilia, a severe and illegal crime. This is a direct attack on the family unit and an attempt to stigmatize and dehumanize parents and children, falling under the 'Hateful' category as it targets a protected characteristic (parenting) with a false and dangerous association.",
